 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "title-cell",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🎙️ 音频转文字 — faster-whisper + 免费 GPU\n",
    "\n",
    "> **调研日期**: 2026-03-31  \n",
    "> **推荐方案**: Google Colab 免费版 + faster-whisper  \n",
    "> **备用环境**: Amazon SageMaker Studio Lab（GPU 单次 4h，24h 内共 4h，环境持久）  \n",
    "> **扩展方案**: WhisperX（需要说话人分离时启用）\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 方案对比速查\n",
    "\n",
    "| 方案 | 速度 | 说话人分离 | 中文精度 | 免费额度 |\n",
    "|------|------|-----------|---------|----------|\n",
    "| openai/whisper | 基准 | ❌ | ✅ | Colab free |\n",
    "| **faster-whisper** ⭐ | **4–5× 基准** | ❌ | ✅ | Colab free |\n",
    "| WhisperX | 快 | ✅ | ✅ | Colab free / Studio Lab |\n",
    "\n",
    "## 免费 GPU 平台排序\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Google Colab free** — 最易上手，免费 T4，单次约 12h（不保证，动态限制）\n",
    "2. **AWS Studio Lab** — 额度最透明：GPU 单次 4h，24h 总共 4h，**环境和包持久化**\n",
    "3. **Lightning AI** — 每月有 free credits，但官方额度页面表述不一致\n",
    "4. **Kaggle** — 社区常用，每周约 30h GPU，但需要手机验证"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "step0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Step 0 — 确认 GPU 环境\n",
    "\n",
    "> Colab：运行时 → 更改运行时类型 → **GPU (T4)**  \n",
    "> Studio Lab：启动时选择 **GPU**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "check-gpu",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import subprocess\n",
    "result = subprocess.run(['nvidia-smi', '--query-gpu=name,memory.total,memory.free', '--format=csv,noheader'], capture_output=True, text=True)\n",
    "if result.returncode == 0:\n",
    "    print('✅ GPU 可用：', result.stdout.strip())\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('⚠️  未检测到 GPU，请在运行时设置中切换到 GPU 后重新运行')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "step1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Step 1 — 安装依赖"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "install",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# faster-whisper 不需要系统预装 ffmpeg（内置 av 库处理音频）\n",
    "# 如需支持更多格式（如 .m4a / .aac），可额外安装 ffmpeg\n",
    "!pip install -q faster-whisper\n",
    "\n",
    "# 可选：如果你的音频是 m4a/aac 等格式，取消注释下面这行\n",
    "# !apt-get install -y -q ffmpeg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "step2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Step 2 — 挂载 Google Drive（推荐）\n",
    "\n",
    "把音频文件放到 Google Drive，这样 Colab 断线重连后不需要重新上传。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "mount-drive",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 查看 Drive 里的文件，方便确认路径\n",
    "import os\n",
    "DRIVE_ROOT = '/content/drive/MyDrive'\n",
    "print('Drive 根目录内容：')\n",
    "for f in sorted(os.listdir(DRIVE_ROOT))[:20]:\n",
    "    print(' ', f)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "step3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Step 3 — 配置参数\n",
    "\n",
    "| 参数 | 推荐值 | 说明 |\n",
    "|------|--------|------|\n",
    "| `MODEL_SIZE` | `large-v3` | 中文精度最佳；追求速度可用 `turbo` |\n",
    "| `LANGUAGE` | `zh` | 中文；多语言混合可填 `None` 自动检测 |\n",
    "| `BATCH_SIZE` | `16` | T4 显存约 15GB，16 是稳定值 |\n",
    "| `VAD_FILTER` | `True` | 自动跳过静音段，节省时间 |\n",
    "| `WORD_TIMESTAMPS` | `True` | 输出词级时间戳，方便做字幕 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "config",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ====== 修改这里 ======\n",
    "AUDIO_PATH   = '/content/drive/MyDrive/audio.mp3'  # 你的音频路径\n",
    "OUTPUT_PATH  = '/content/drive/MyDrive/transcript.txt'  # 输出文字路径\n",
    "SRT_PATH     = '/content/drive/MyDrive/transcript.srt'  # 输出字幕路径（可选）\n",
    "\n",
    "MODEL_SIZE   = 'large-v3'   # 可选: tiny / base / small / medium / large-v3 / turbo\n",
    "LANGUAGE     = 'zh'          # 中文: 'zh'; 自动检测: None\n",
    "BATCH_SIZE   = 16\n",
    "VAD_FILTER   = True\n",
    "WORD_TIMESTAMPS = True\n",
    "# =====================\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "assert os.path.exists(AUDIO_PATH), f'❌ 找不到音频文件: {AUDIO_PATH}'\n",
    "print(f'✅ 音频文件大小: {os.path.getsize(AUDIO_PATH) / 1024 / 1024:.1f} MB')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "step4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Step 4 — 加载模型 & 转录"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "transcribe",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import time\n",
    "from faster_whisper import WhisperModel, BatchedInferencePipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'⏳ 加载模型 {MODEL_SIZE} ...')\n",
    "t0 = time.time()\n",
    "model = WhisperModel(MODEL_SIZE, device='cuda', compute_type='float16')\n",
    "batched_model = BatchedInferencePipeline(model=model)\n",
    "print(f'✅ 模型加载完成，耗时 {time.time()-t0:.1f}s')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n⏳ 开始转录...')\n",
    "t1 = time.time()\n",
    "segments, info = batched_model.transcribe(\n",
    "    AUDIO_PATH,\n",
    "    batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,\n",
    "    vad_filter=VAD_FILTER,\n",
    "    word_timestamps=WORD_TIMESTAMPS,\n",
    "    language=LANGUAGE,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 收集结果（generator 惰性求值，需要 list 展开）\n",
    "segments = list(segments)\n",
    "elapsed = time.time() - t1\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'✅ 转录完成！共 {len(segments)} 段，耗时 {elapsed:.1f}s')\n",
    "print(f'   检测语言: {info.language}，置信度: {info.language_probability:.2%}')\n",
    "print(f'   音频时长: {info.duration:.1f}s  →  实时率: {info.duration/elapsed:.1f}×')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "step5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Step 5 — 保存输出"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "save-txt",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ----- 纯文本 -----\n",
    "with open(OUTPUT_PATH, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n",
    "    for seg in segments:\n",
    "        f.write(seg.text.strip() + '\\n')\n",
    "print(f'✅ 纯文本已保存: {OUTPUT_PATH}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# ----- SRT 字幕 -----\n",
    "def fmt_time(sec):\n",
    "    h, r = divmod(int(sec), 3600)\n",
    "    m, s = divmod(r, 60)\n",
    "    ms = int((sec - int(sec)) * 1000)\n",
    "    return f'{h:02d}:{m:02d}:{s:02d},{ms:03d}'\n",
    "\n",
    "with open(SRT_PATH, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n",
    "    for i, seg in enumerate(segments, 1):\n",
    "        f.write(f'{i}\\n')\n",
    "        f.write(f'{fmt_time(seg.start)} --> {fmt_time(seg.end)}\\n')\n",
    "        f.write(seg.text.strip() + '\\n\\n')\n",
    "print(f'✅ SRT 字幕已保存: {SRT_PATH}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 预览前 5 段\n",
    "print('\\n--- 前 5 段预览 ---')\n",
    "for seg in segments[:5]:\n",
    "    print(f'[{seg.start:.1f}s → {seg.end:.1f}s] {seg.text.strip()}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "step6-diarize",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
